{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1549607-the-chrysalis-contract","id":1549607,"title":"The Chrysalis Contract","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-03-27T14:57:07-07:00","id":1549607,"title":"The Chrysalis Contract","content":"I made a Beast/Nightsinger character I based of the German Nixie. Now I was wondering if the Chrysalis Contract can be used to transform my character into mermaid form considering the fact that the character would not have access to the swimmerskin Kith blessing being a nightsinger and all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-27T18:18:08-07:00","id":1549611,"title":"","content":"Strictly as written, you can pick a mythical beast but don't get any magical powers from it, so you can definitely be a mermaid and it's just a question of what rules to use for the mermaid (a.k.a., if you're basing it on the Swimmerskin, the argument of whether a mermaid being able to swim at double speed and use weapons underwater is a magical power or just a property of having a mermaid body).<br /> <br /> I would personally be fine with letting a player just take the Swimmerskin mermaid form as a Chrysalis form, noting only that unlike a Swimmerskin, you can't transform reflexively, it costs the 2 Glamour of Chrysalis rather than the 1 of the blessing, and while the Swimmerskin can just always breathe either air or water regardless of form, you only get that benefit when in the mermaid form. Not a large difference practically speaking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-28T02:35:21-07:00","id":1549614,"title":"","content":"Thanks for your input and I have one further question about this Contract. It says that any user of the contract can pick two animals to turn into and that the Beast Seeming benefit allows them to choose two additional animals. My question is this, is a character required to choose multiple animal forms or can one limit their choice to one animal form that fits best with the character like a mermaid form for a nixie for instance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-28T17:59:38-07:00","id":1549626,"title":"","content":"Nothing requires you to use the contract for all of the alternate forms it <i>can</i> give you. Consider yourself to have three more unchosen forms &quot;in reserve&quot; in case you ever change your mind and decide there is another form you want to be able to take.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[